<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major></Major>
    <Description>Hello, Macroers! Today I bring you an updated version from the Teras Farming.

As always, a few things to consider:
1) Have a magnetic ID. Please invest in one, as it will make everything easier. If you don't have it or don't want it, then please add a 4 to the macro on the first part so you can pick up the loot.
2) Have either a strong Digi with a good F1 so you can go farm anywhere, or if you don't, go to File Island Waterfront where you will be able to kill every digi with almost any F1. I recommend either Verdandi Terminal (Have an X-digi here) for X tickets, Yin Yang and seals; or Minato City for Witchmon seals, eggs and Teras. Also, you can go to Sukyamon or Gesomon seals, eggs, and Teras.
3) Put DS disc on F5 and Health disc on F6

Now, considering the macro:
1) You will move. It is not for farming, it is to distract people from thinking you are macroing. The movement is subtle, just a little to the north, and then a little to the south.
2) If you have a strong digi, you may be able to instakill with F1 and 1, so you will insta kill everything around you. If you have an X digi, please change de DS disc for X-antibody so it doesn't devolve.

Good luck!</Description>
    <Comment>https://botmek.com - Free macros download</Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>0</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
